# Yaml.roc:1 at this tag is `import Parser exposing [Parser]`. Nightlies from
# 2026-10-04 reject that line with a redundant-expose error. The compiler loads
# only the modules that an app imports, so only an app that imports parser.Yaml
# fails: parser_yaml, parser_markdown, and basic-cli's scripting topic.
#
# The fix is upstream (8d20a47, branch automation/roc-nightly, PR #87), but no
# release has it. Every file here pins 2.0.0. When those three programs fail as
# written, scripts/gate-overrides.json lets check:platforms compile them
# against a copy of 2.0.0 with patches/gate-0001-yaml-redundant-expose.patch
# applied. The server serves no patched file.
#
# When a release has the fix, repin every file that names the tarball above,
# and point the manual links at the new tag. Then remove the override entry
# and the gate- patch. src/gate_overrides.test.ts fails until both are gone.
